Please perform final polish on the chapter: elevate language, pacing, and paragraph rhythm while keeping all plot facts completely unchanged. After polishing, continuity and causality review will run again—no key events, character relationship conclusions, or exit states may be altered.

{{ render_artifact_source_contract(source, title="## Source Artifact Boundary (P0)", mode="polish") }}

{% if cognitive_constraints %}
## Cognitive Preservation Boundary (P0)
- Polish syntax, rhythm, and expression density only. Do not change any named role's `unknown|partial|full` coverage or turn inner cognition into public action.
{% endif %}

## Polish Consumption Rules
- Only consume corrected text, evaluation/expression issues, word count guidance, and style projection.
- Do not add new plot facts, character knowledge, event ledger, relationship conclusions, identity confirmations, or future payoffs.
- If language optimization would alter event outcomes or information hierarchy, preserve the original factual expression and only fine-tune syntax and rhythm.
- Polish does not consume book-level initialization sources, character bundles, or cross-scene intents; it keeps only the minimal cognitive contract above because polishing can otherwise alter that boundary.
- Voice, symbolism explanations, aftermath, and body signal budgets are only for "fine-tuning syntax and rhythm," not for "altering plot facts."

## Chapter Information
- Chapter {{ chapter_number }} "{{ chapter_title }}"
- Tone: {{ tone }}
{% if genre %}- Genre: {{ genre }}{% endif %}
{% if pov_character %}- POV Character: {{ pov_character }}{% endif %}
{% if target_word_count %}- Target Word Count: approximately {{ target_word_count }} words{% endif %}
{% if position %}
- Chapter Position: Chapter {{ position.chapter_number | default(chapter_number) }} / {{ position.total_chapters }}; is_last_chapter={{ position.is_last_chapter | default(false) }}.
{% if position.is_last_chapter | default(false) %}
- This chapter is the book finale of the current outline; book-level closing tone may be retained, but no facts outside the contract may be added.
{% else %}
- This chapter is not the book finale: polishing must not rewrite it as a book ending, and must not add final settlements, final fate determinations, or full-line payoffs.
{% endif %}
{% if position.is_previously_final_chapter | default(false) %}
- This chapter was a former final chapter but has been extended: retain onlystage-levellanding point (stage-level landing points), weaken final chapter tone.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

